WEBVTT

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:11.020
The time for me to use
this has finally come.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.900
For he is the
perfect opponent.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:20.440
Takao Kinomiya...

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:24.530
I will defeat you!
For the honor of the Siebald family!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:57.660
Justice 5!
BEGA VS G-Revolutions!

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:01.220
The fifth and final battle...

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:05.450
Will be Takao Kinomiya VS Garland!

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:16.680
You can't lose,
or even draw.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.760
We have to win.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.700
But Garland,
our next opponent...

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.330
He might be the
strongest Blader in BEGA.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.880
You mean that waa-chyaa guy is stronger than the redhead?

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:31.060
Yes...

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.980
If Brooklyn is a
natural born genius...

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:38.980
Then Garland gained his
abilities through hard work.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.780
A hard working genius...

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:45.340
I've heard that he's been
taught the way of sport

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:49.900
ever since he was young, due
to his family's upbringing.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.450
And that means...

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:56.520
Takao has to fight Garland; someone stronger than Brooklyn, who Kai struggled against.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.540
That seems
to be the case.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:02.840
This'll be an even tougher
battle than Brooklyn's.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:06.050
Garland.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:09.100
BEGA's victory is
all riding on you.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.380
I will win. I vow it.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:18.170
But not for BEGA. I will win for
the honor of the Siebald family!

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.760
Honor of the
Siebald family...

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.290
What are you reading?

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:28.330
This is a book of principles passed
down in the Siebald family.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:34.100
Members of the Siebald family are to carry these principles with them.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:39.460
My oldest brother is guaranteed to make
his third win in the major leagues.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:42.200
My second-oldest
brother is an F1 racer.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:47.320
He won the championship two years in a row, and is set to win a third.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.890
My older sister
won the Wimbledon.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.880
And I...

00:04:56.260 --> 00:05:01.090
Much like my siblings, aim to become the best Beyblader in the world.

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.130
No, I will
become the best!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.980
For the honor of
the Siebald family!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:11.010
Is this what's
destined for all Siebalds?

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:14.600
It is not as simple
as mere destiny.

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:20.860
It's the path laid out
before us by the gods.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:31.920
I was not expecting
Brooklyn to lose.

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:36.480
A Blader willing to risk their
life is something to fear.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:50.460
You don't seem so
bothered by this.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.120
I don't care about
your ridiculous report!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:06:00.760
I want to know if we can
win the next match!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:05.690
No, it doesn't matter
if we "can." We have to!

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:08.360
Win... Win...

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.370
We must win!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:13.650
I'm sick of this standstill!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:34.520
I won, Kinomiya.
And now it's your turn.

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.980
Leave it to me, Kai.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.840
I'm going to win!

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.400
And then I'm next.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.760
Got it?

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:47.280
My pleasure.
I'll wrap this up in no time!

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:55.530
Watch my battle, Kai!

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:56.840
I will win!

00:06:56.840 --> 00:07:01.720
I'm going to crush Volkov's plans
and protect our Beybattles!

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:04.500
Garland!

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.440
I'm excited to fight you!

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:12.600
Y'all are all so gloomy!

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.250
Takao's not gonna lose!

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:18.260
Chill out, Daichi!

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:19.530
Calm down, Daichi!

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.090
I won't lose!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.810
--Takao!

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.610
This is perfect. Can you help
me out with something?

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.320
With what?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.160
You guys are
thinking too much!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.020
I'm feeling great!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.480
You gotta be!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.690
Yes...

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.410
That's just like you, Takao!

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:50.290
Sorry for worrying so much.

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:56.030
Is this okay?
Your match is soon.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:08:01.560
I'm going to be fighting Garland! For the whole world to see!

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:05.200
I felt like my body was gonna
explode if I didn't get moving!

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:07.170
Einstein!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:11.660
This is the perfect warm-up for
you to blow off some steam.

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:16.100
He can even turn pre-match
nerves into excitement!

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:19.580
Takao has such a strong spirit.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.840
Yeah, Takao's
got a big heart!

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.250
You better win, Takao!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.440
Now you've done it, Daichi!

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.680
Got 'em!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.540
--Go!
--I won't lose!

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:37.690
Einstein!

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:40.020
Go, Draciel!

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:44.660
Thanks. All of you.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.840
For coming all
this way with me.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:49.980
How embarrassing!

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.680
You're gonna
make me blush!

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.170
Even so...

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.170
We've been through a lot.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:59.770
Yeah. All because of BEGA.

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:04.240
Their monopoly on Beyblade
parts was a big problem.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:06.410
We trained in
the mountains.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:09.770
None of us could
control these at first.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.780
I'm glad we
all got together.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:17.120
It's awesome that there's so
many of us who love Beyblade!

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:22.800
And the curry
was to die for!

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:24.300
Come on, Daichi!

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.720
What?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.370
We've been through lots,
but it was fun!

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.040
It really was.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:35.370
Hey, now.
We're not done yet!

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:43.580
Daichi. Rei.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:46.060
Kyoujyu. Max.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:49.250
And Kai!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.250
The baton has
been passed to me!

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:56.320
So now
I'm up to bat!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.990
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:06.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.160
The time has come!

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:15.930
Will Garland win and
deliver victory to BEGA?

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:19.560
Or will Takao Kinomiya
hold his ground

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:22.490
to keep the
G-Revolutions in the game?!

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:26.820
This will be the
stage for their battle!

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.060
The Combat Stadium!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:33.640
Their two Beys will clash
like a pair of fists!

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:43.180
I've been waiting
for this, Garland.

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:47.160
I will win. For the honor
of the Siebald family!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.960
--Three! Two! One!
--Three! Two! One!

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.700
Go, Shoot!

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:07.410
Dragoon lands the first punch!

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:12.060
This is Garland's typical style of taking his opponent's attacks!

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.880
Knock him flying!

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:27.540
Siebald family
principle number one.

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:31.200
The battle begins after
knowing your opponent.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:35.560
Siebald family principle?

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:40.290
And now it's my turn.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:43.050
Siebald family principle
number eight.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:48.000
Victory goes to those
who land the first strike!

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:57.760
Apollon deals a
devastating assault!

00:11:57.760 --> 00:12:01.360
Is he going to
push Dragoon out?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.370
--Takao!

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.220
Never!

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:11.060
Dragoon's on Apollon!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:14.100
And now Garland's in trouble!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:17.860
Siebald family principle
number twenty three.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.680
Even with one's back
turned to an opponent...

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:22.840
Do not turn your mind!

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:31.770
Apollon makes a graceful
rise to its next attack!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.880
Fly, Dragoon!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:37.250
Dragoon takes flight too!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:42.320
Is Garland turning his back
on this tough situation?!

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:46.370
Siebald family principle
number twenty eight.

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.480
Take the road less traveled.

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:53.440
For there lies the
path to victory!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:13:00.840
Apollon makes a sudden
turn into a strong attack!

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.370
Takao!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.970
What's Garland talking about?

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:09.120
Takao! Don't lose to this
guy's babbling nonsense!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.930
No, it's not nonsense!

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.330
It's so sensible it's terrifying!

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:18.370
I've heard of this.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:24.090
That there's a book of principles passed from generation to generation in the Siebald family!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:25.220
Principles?

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.890
Whassat?

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:31.480
They're teachings passed
down through the family!

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:36.330
It's the Siebald family's
formula for victory!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.400
Principles...

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.410
But why wasn't
he using it before?!

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:44.100
He didn't need
them until now.

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:49.380
He's using them because he acknowledges Takao as a worthy opponent!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.390
Well?

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.520
How do you like that taste
of my family's principles?

00:13:55.800 --> 00:14:01.080
The history of the Siebald family is the history of sport itself!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:05.020
The three pillars of battle.
Mind, technique, and physique.

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:09.280
The formula for victory
developed by my ancestors...

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:13.140
That is the Siebald
family book of principles!

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:17.320
Siebald family principle
number forty five.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:21.290
Defeat a worthy
opponent with utmost respect!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.260
Go, Apollon!

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:32.620
No!

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.930
Takao can't
even fight back!

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:39.770
How's that?

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:45.520
This is the history of the Siebalds.
The significance of our principles!

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:49.200
Excellent, Garland!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:54.620
Defeat Takao Kinomiya down
to his skin, bones, and spirit!

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:58.570
Prepare a toast.

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:01.680
Siebald family principle
number seventy nine.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:08.130
Deliver a glorious final blow.

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:14.050
You should feel honored to become a page in the history books of the Siebald family.

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:17.780
And now it's over!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.350
--Takao!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.690
You're strong, but
something's not right.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:28.800
Who am I really fighting?

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:35.050
Dragoon stopped
the attack! It held on!

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.480
--Takao!

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:40.740
A final act of resistance?

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:48.220
That won't even
make me flinch!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:52.060
You can't beat me!

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.680
A bluff?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.890
You, for fighting
for your family honor!

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.100
What?!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:02.850
Why do you fight?

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:05.240
It's simple.

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:09.480
Because I love Beyblade!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:16.410
You can enjoy Beyblade anywhere,
anytime, and with whoever!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:20.100
Watching the Beys
clash is fun as heck!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:30.840
And that Beyblading...

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:34.050
The same Beyblading Kai
risked his life to protect...

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:39.160
You can't have it!

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:43.640
How absurd!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:47.690
Fun?! Sport has no
meaning without victory!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.780
"Fun" is just an excuse
for the weak!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:54.170
For that is how it is written in
the Siebald family principles!

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.300
But why?

00:16:57.300 --> 00:17:01.330
I was looking forward
to battling you.

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:05.900
Fighting someone as strong as
you for the whole world to see!

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:08.620
That's nonsense.

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.780
You're fighting me right
now, are you not?

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:13.090
I'm not!

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:20.460
I've been fighting a fake Garland
manipulated by his family principles!

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:22.220
Are you saying that...

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.230
I am not me?

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.840
I wanna fight Garland!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:31.800
Throw those principles in the trash and show me what you've got!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:35.300
Show me that Beyspirit!!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.000
I am...

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.100
My own person, before I am a member of the Siebald family.

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:45.360
I fight as Garland Siebald.

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:47.690
That is me!

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:53.140
Very well. Then I won't
fight with my principles.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:55.840
Get a taste of
who I truly am!

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.220
Now you're talking!

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:07.360
This is where
their battle begins!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:42.040
Garland's amazing!

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:44.140
Takao's amazing too!

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:46.420
Go, both of you!

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:55.450
What is this?

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:57.330
What's going on here?

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:01.080
You're awesome, Garland!

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.250
So are you!

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.480
Both of them are smiling!

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:10.660
It's clear they're
enjoying the battle!

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:19.380
It's a shame that
this has to end!

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:22.660
Yeah, you're right.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.600
However...

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.400
I'm going to end it now!

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:28.740
Okay!

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:31.260
Here I come,
Takao Kinomiya!

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:33.740
Experience it
for yourself.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:38.490
My own self.
My own technique. My own soul!

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:44.940
Radiant Thunder!!

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:51.220
Evolution Storm!!

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:25.450
I see now...

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:41.400
We have a winner!

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:45.730
Takao Kinomiya of the
G-Revolutions wins!

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:47.420
Yes!!

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:52.120
The G-Revolutions
won the last battle!

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:02.460
Our battle was the best!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.010
I lost...

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:09.050
But I have no regrets!

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.690
Useless!

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:28.840
BEGA VS G-Revolutions! The Justice 5 ends with each having two wins, two losses, and a draw!

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:32.720
What happens next?!

00:22:55.760 --> 00:23:01.140
I realize this is sudden, but I'm a little disappointed in you, Coach Kinomiya.

00:23:01.140 --> 00:23:06.780
The responsibility for our draw lies
on you. And you as well, Garland!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:09.740
Beyblading is fun?
Acknowledge your opponent?

00:23:09.740 --> 00:23:13.480
Losing to Kinomiya has made
you soft, you goddamn loser!

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:16.000
At this point, I'll do
whatever it takes to win.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:19.720
One match to go.
Let's "warm up" to win the next battle.

00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:22.420
I'm sure you
know what I mean.
